   "explain": "E₄ > E₃ > E₂ > E₁, so the N shell (4th) has the most energy."
  }
 ],
 "takeaways": [
  "Shells (energy levels) are K, L, M, N … with n = 1, 2, 3, 4 …",
  "Maximum electrons in a shell = **2n²**: 2, 8, 18, 32.",
  "The shell nearest the nucleus has the least energy."
 ]
